   "title": "README",
   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "# AlexVale \u2014 LTX image-to-video (fast/dreamy)\n\n**LTX-Video** image-to-video, ~3-5 min per 4s clip. Length = 8n+1 frames @24fps.\n\n**Character:** soft, atmospheric motion \u2014 great for dreamy shimmer, WEAK for real camera travel. For an actual dolly with a locked subject, use **Wan_VACE_i2v_fast** instead.\n\nChained across clips by `tools/shot_chain.py` (color-anchor + keyframe-repair fix the drift).\n\n---\n\ud83d\udcda [Tutorial](https://docs.comfy.org/) \u00b7 Docs: https://docs.comfy.org/"
   ],
   "color": "#432",
   "bgcolor": "#653"
  },
